```

Xu's [Section 8](https://arxiv.org/abs/1604.07683) independently derives this `(deg R,ord R)=(40,-25)` statement
at a radius-two principal-minor split.  Thus the following is
`CONDITIONAL[T3-RADIUS2-LEADER]` from the frozen Moh pages alone, and
`EXTERNAL-DERIVED` if that later result is admitted.

Proposition 4.1 applied to `(T_3^psi,g)` and the equality
