## 4. The live `D=108` row

### 4.1 What is and is not determined

`MEASURED / EXACT-ARITHMETIC`:

```text
n=108, m=72, s=3
M_1..M_3 = (-72,81,106)
d_1..d_4 = (108,36,9,1)
V_2,V_3 = (7,7)
v_3=7, u_3=d_3-v_3=2, v_3/u_3=7/2
major (delta_1,delta_2,delta_3) = (3/8,1/4,-1).
