Def.5.1 gives the unstarred radii; Prop.6.1 gives only `delta_2^*>=1`.
No source gives this row actual contacts, so the `7/2` bound is
**UNDETERMINED**; substituting major `1/4` would be invalid.

P.150 gives `mu_1=-72` and
