+
+    Omega^-1(x^e*y^j)=X^(j-e)[X^2(Y-a0)-a1X-a2]^j.  Thus a face
+    monomial is individually polynomial of old degree at most D when
+    j-e>=0 and 4j-e<=D.  Cancellation is not used here.
+    """
