+Writing its four coefficient rows as
+
+```text
+f1=5-k,
+f2=(k-4)(a+b)+3ell,
+f3=(3-k)ab-2(a+b)ell,
+f4=ab*ell,
+f5=T*ab(a-b)k-1,
