+```text
+COUNTING-BOUND[B-FULL-LIFT]
+deepest certified slice band = 4
+slice dimension there = 50 over Q(a), 51 including a
+next exact system = equations (5.14)--(5.17)
+SURVIVES[DELTA-5/2-LEADING-FACE]
+NO KELLER PAIR PRODUCED
+```

