+deepest certified consistent slice band = 5
+deepest fully counted slice band = 5
+exact fixed-c dimension there = 58 over Q(a), 59 including a
+next exact system = equations (5.19)--(5.23)
+SURVIVES[DELTA-5/2-LEADING-FACE]
+NO KELLER PAIR PRODUCED
+```

