+pass.  This is a solver/wrapper control, not a branch-B pair.  The controls
+manifest also passes.
+
+FALLACY-v2 audit: a face is never promoted to a pair; cover roots are not
+called physical places; saturations have declared rings, wrappers, and
+positive/negative controls; (2.1) is the variable map; remainders live in
+`Q(a)[z]` with `a != 0`; and no floor, attainment, exit, or carrier claim is
+made.  Missing centre/route data cause the typed counting stop.
+
+The final conclusion remains:
